<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mathe-Erkundungslabor [BS+1]: Zahlenmengen, Wertetabellen &amp; Zuordnungen</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-page: #F8FAFC;
      --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
      --text-main: #0F172A;
      --text-muted: #475569;
      --border-light: #E2E8F0;

      /* System-Farbpalette */
      --step-inactive-bg: #E2E8F0;
      --step-inactive-text: #475569;
      --step-active-bg: #1565C0;
      --step-active-text: #FFFFFF;
      --step-done-bg: #2E7D32;
      --step-done-text: #FFFFFF;

      --tile-bg: #F1F5F9;
      --tile-text: #0F172A;
      --tile-border: #E2E8F0;
      --tile-active-bg: #3B82F6;
      --tile-active-border: #2563EB;

      --info-yellow-bg: #FEF9E7;
      --info-yellow-text: #000000;

      --warn-red-bg: #FDE8E8;
      --warn-red-text: #7F1D1D;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-page);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.55;
      padding-bottom: 64px;
    }

    /* Header & Orientierungsleiste */
    .app-header {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .brand-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .badge-bs1 {
      background: #1565C0;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 3px 9px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    .header-top-pills {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .step-pill {
      background: var(--step-inactive-bg);
      color: var(--step-inactive-text);
      border: none;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .step-pill:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .step-pill.active {
      background: var(--step-active-bg);
      color: var(--step-active-text);
      font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.3);
    }

    .step-pill.completed {
      background: var(--step-done-bg);
      color: var(--step-done-text);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn-primary {
      background: #1565C0;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: none;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.25);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: #1E40AF;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-primary:disabled {
      background: #94A3B8;
      box-shadow: none;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .btn-success {
      background: #2E7D32;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: none;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.25);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn-success:hover {
      background: #1B5E20;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: #EFF6FF;
      color: #1D4ED8;
      border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
      padding: 9px 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #DBEAFE;
    }

    .btn-secondary.selected-variant {
      background: #1565C0;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: #1E40AF;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-nav {
      background: #F1F5F9;
      color: #0F172A;
      border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
      padding: 7px 13px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-nav:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: #E2E8F0;
    }

    /* Main Container */
    .main-container {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 24px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .card-white {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
    }

    .info-card-yellow {
      background: var(--info-yellow-bg);
      color: var(--info-yellow-text);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #FDE68A;
    }

    .warn-card-red {
      background: var(--warn-red-bg);
      color: var(--warn-red-text);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 13px 15px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #FCA5A5;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    /* Oberkategorien-Karten auf der Startseite */
    .overview-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(330px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .area-card {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 2px solid #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .area-card.pale-locked {
      opacity: 0.45;
      background: #F1F5F9;
      border-style: dashed;
      filter: grayscale(0.45);
    }

    .area-card.ready-active {
      border-color: #1565C0;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.12);
    }

    .area-card.completed-area {
      opacity: 1;
      filter: none;
      border-color: #2E7D32;
      background: #F0FDF4;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.12);
    }

    .status-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .status-badge.active {
      background: #DBEAFE;
      color: #1E3A8A;
    }

    .status-badge.locked {
      background: #E2E8F0;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .status-badge.done {
      background: #2E7D32;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    /* Sub-Stepper für die Unterstruktur */
    .sub-stepper-box {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .sub-pills-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Schritt-für-Schritt-Schreibweisen-Baukasten */
    .notation-builder-box {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border: 2px solid #BFDBFE;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .notation-display-bar {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 2px solid #1565C0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 10px 0 14px 0;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .notation-part-active {
      background: #FEF08A;
      color: #0F172A;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #EAB308;
    }

    .symbol-steps-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .symbol-step-card {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }

    .symbol-step-card.active-step {
      border: 2px solid #1565C0;
      background: #EFF6FF;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.15);
    }

    .symbol-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #1E3A8A;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    /* Pädagogische Lernübersicht / Merkblatt */
    .summary-sheet {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 2px solid #1565C0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.08);
    }

    .summary-sheet-header {
      background: #EFF6FF;
      border-left: 5px solid #1565C0;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #1E3A8A;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .summary-grid-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .summary-mini-card {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    /* Abschluss-Banner */
    .completion-banner {
      background: #ECFDF5;
      border: 2px solid #2E7D32;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.14);
      animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
    }

    .ab-task-highlight {
      background: #FEF9E7;
      border: 2px solid #F59E0B;
      color: #000000;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      margin: 12px 0 16px 0;
    }

    .completion-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    /* Beispiel-Karten */
    .example-cards-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 14px 0;
    }

    .example-pick-card {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border: 2px solid #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.18s ease;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .example-pick-card:hover {
      border-color: #1565C0;
      background: #EFF6FF;
    }

    .example-pick-card.picked-correct {
      border-color: #2E7D32;
      background: #DCFCE7;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .example-pick-card.picked-wrong {
      border-color: #DC2626;
      background: #FDE8E8;
    }

    .example-num {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0F172A;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .example-desc {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* Klickbares Glossar */
    .math-term-clickable {
      color: #1A73E8;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: underline dotted 1.5px #1A73E8;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .math-term-clickable:hover {
      color: #1557B0;
      background: rgba(26, 115, 232, 0.07);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Brüche (Anti-LaTeX) */
    .math-fraction {
      display: inline-flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      vertical-align: middle;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .math-numerator {
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .math-denominator {
      border-top: 1.5px solid currentColor;
      padding-top: 2px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    /* Grids & Layouts */
    .two-col-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .canvas-wrapper {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    canvas {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    /* Themenkacheln */
    .tiles-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 14px 0;
    }

    .topic-tile {
      background: var(--tile-bg);
      color: var(--tile-text);
      border: 1px solid var(--tile-border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .topic-tile:hover {
      border-color: #94A3B8;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .topic-tile.selected {
      background: var(--tile-active-bg);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border-color: var(--tile-active-border);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    }

    .topic-tile.selected .tile-sub {
      color: #EFF6FF;
    }

    .tile-sub {
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: #475569;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* Wertetabelle */
    .wt-scroll-container {
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }

    .wt-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-align: center;
      background: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .wt-table th, .wt-table td {
      border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      min-width: 54px;
    }

    .wt-table th {
      background: #EFF6FF;
      color: #1E3A8A;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .wt-input {
      width: 68px;
      padding: 5px;
      border: 2px solid #3B82F6;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* Freitext-Prüfer */
    .freetext-area {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 92px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 2px solid #94A3B8;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
      resize: vertical;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .freetext-area:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #1565C0;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.15);
    }

    /* Rohdaten-Notizzettel in Bereich 2 */
    .raw-notes-paper {
      background: #FFFBEB;
      border: 2px dashed #F59E0B;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #1E293B;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    /* Modal Glossar */
    .modal-backdrop {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .modal-backdrop.open {
      display: flex;
    }

    .modal-card {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
      max-width: 430px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      position: relative;
    }

    .modal-close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 16px;
      right: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .two-col-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      canvas {
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- =======================================================================
       GLOBALER HEADER MIT ORIENTIERUNGSLEISTE
       ======================================================================= -->
  <header class="app-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="brand-title" onclick="showOverview()" title="Zurück zur Hauptübersicht">
        <span>📐 Mathe-Erkundungslabor</span>
        <span class="badge-bs1">[BS+1]</span>
      </div>

      <nav class="header-top-pills" aria-label="Lernbereiche">
        <button class="step-pill active" id="top-pill-overview" onclick="showOverview()">
          🏠 Übersicht
        </button>
        <button class="step-pill" id="top-pill-1" onclick="openArea(1)">
          1. Zahlenmengen
        </button>
        <button class="step-pill" id="top-pill-2" onclick="openArea(2)">
          2. Daten &amp; Wertetabelle
        </button>
        <button class="step-pill" id="top-pill-3" onclick="openArea(3)">
          3. Zuordnungen &amp; Beziehungen
        </button>
      </nav>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center;">
        <button class="btn-nav" onclick="showOverview()">🏠 Lernbereich-Startseite</button>
        <button class="btn-nav" onclick="resetAllProgress()" title="Gesamten Lernstand zurücksetzen">↺ Reset</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-container">

    <!-- =====================================================================
         1. OBERFLÄCHENSTRUKTUR: HAUPTÜBERSICHT DER 3 LERNBEREICHE (STARTSEITE)
         ===================================================================== -->
    <section id="view-overview">
      <div class="card-white">
        <h1 style="font-size: 1.55rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          Dein Lernpfad: Zahlenmengen, Wertetabellen &amp; Zuordnungen <span class="badge-bs1">[BS+1]</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="info-card-yellow" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
          💡 <strong>So funktioniert dein Lernpfad:</strong> Du erarbeitest dir nacheinander <strong>drei aufeinander aufbauende Lernbereiche</strong>. Jeder Bereich baut sich Schritt für Schritt auf, damit du dich voll auf den aktuellen Schwerpunkt konzentrieren kannst. Sobald ein Bereich vollständig gelöst ist, erhältst du deine <strong>kompakte Lernübersicht (Merkblatt)</strong> sowie den passenden Arbeitsauftrag für das <strong>1. AB (Arbeitsblatt)</strong> und schaltest den nächsten Lernbereich mit einem <strong>grünen Haken (&#10003;)</strong> frei!
        </div>

        <div class="overview-grid">

          <!-- OBERKATEGORIE 1 -->
          <div class="area-card" id="area-card-1">
            <div>
              <div class="status-badge active" id="area-badge-1">📍 Aktueller Lernbereich 1</div>
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.22rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                1. <span class="math-term-clickable" onclick="openGlossary('zahlenmengen')">Zahlenmengen</span> &amp; mathematische Schreibweise
              </h2>
              <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                Ordne Alltagsbeispiele selbst zu, entdecke das Schachtelsystem (<strong>&#8469; &sub; &#8469;<sub>0</sub> &sub; &#8484; &sub; &#8474; &sub; &#8477;</strong>) und baue die exakte mathematische Schreibweise Symbol für Symbol auf.
              </p>
              <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #475569; background: #F8FAFC; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                <strong>Unterstruktur (5 Stufen):</strong> 1.1 &#8469; &rarr; 1.2 &#8469;<sub>0</sub> &rarr; 1.3 &#8484; &rarr; 1.4 &#8474; &rarr; 1.5 &#8477; &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Abschluss: Aufgabe 2a (1. AB)</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="area-actions-1"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- OBERKATEGORIE 2 -->
          <div class="area-card" id="area-card-2">
            <div>
              <div class="status-badge locked" id="area-badge-2">🔒 Lernbereich 2</div>
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.22rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                2. Praxisdaten mit einer <span class="math-term-clickable" onclick="openGlossary('wertetabelle')">Wertetabelle</span> strukturieren
              </h2>
              <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                Wähle zuerst deine reale Praxissituation aus, vergleiche lose Notizen direkt mit der Wertetabelle im Freitext-Prüfer und übertrage die Rohdaten in eine saubere Struktur.
              </p>
